# uv's isolated venv, materialized on first launch under this directory by
# `uv run --directory ${__dirname} src/server.py` (see manifest.json). Never
# packed: it does not exist at pack time in CI, and even a stray local one
# from a manual `uv run` in this directory must not end up inside the bundle.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
